atlas evidence

architecture proof-frontier
  owns ProofFrontier
  consumes Evidence
  consumes WorkState
  publishes ProofFrontier
  canonical_name ProofFrontierGraph
  family evidence
  domain Evidence / Anti-Amnesia
  layer governance/proof
  semantic_question Given what is already settled, may this mutation touch this layer?
  purpose Orders a subject's correctness layers so the first open one is unambiguous; cools proven layers against reheat conditions. Governs FPQ, Bernstein adapters, Habitat equally.
  maturity measured
  node_types SolvedInvariant
  node_types KnownNonCause
  node_types FrontierLayer
  edge_types cools
  edge_types reheats
  edge_types below_frontier
  state_types cooled
  state_types challenged
  state_types invalidated
  internal_calculus RegressionFence decision
  internal_calculus first-open-layer derivation
  invariant a cooled invariant must name what reheats it or it is settled forever against reality
  invariant only a signal matching a named reheat condition may challenge a cooled invariant
  invariant a layer below the first open layer is proven ground and off-limits
  forbidden_inference a garbage symptom at a high layer -> authorization to reopen a low proven layer
  forbidden_inference measured cosine -> proof of behavioural equivalence
  forbidden_inference a docstring claiming isomorphism -> a proof of one
  native_format crux
  command BonfyreProof
  source_path 10-Code/BonfyreControlPlane/proof_frontier.py
  source_path 10-Code/BonfyreControlPlane/seed_fpq_frontier.py
  source_path schemas/control/proof-frontier.yaff
  source_path engine/core/src/proof.c
  source_path engine/core/include/bf_proof.h
  witness 10-Code/BonfyreControlPlane/tests/test_fpq_evidence.py
  witness packs/fpq-proof-frontier/measured-witness.yaff
  witness engine/core/tests/proof_test.c
  source_lineage run4_institutional_fabric anti-amnesia campaign
  known_gap native peer owns the frontier_layers / solved_invariants / known_noncauses stores; it preserves the FPQ discipline (a measured invariant is never proven -- proven requires truth_plane=proven and not challenged/invalidated), challenge retracts proof, and a KnownNonCause blackholes a hypothesis in scope. Python reads native-written rows with the discipline intact -- parity proven. The DBSP incremental maintenance of ReachableCapacity from this frontier stays in Feldera (P1).
  reheat_condition a named reheat signal satisfies a cooled invariant on a proven layer

architecture evidence-binding
  canonical_name EvidenceBindingGraph
  family evidence
  domain Evidence
  layer evidence
  semantic_question Does this candidate artifact actually satisfy this evidence requirement?
  purpose The binding relation is itself an object: requirement -> candidate retrieval -> semantic test -> binding -> witness.
  maturity implemented
  node_types EvidenceRequirement
  node_types EvidenceCandidate
  node_types EvidenceBinding
  node_types EvidenceBindingWitness
  edge_types retrieves
  edge_types binds
  internal_calculus semantic-test matching, most-constrained-first, unique
  invariant a requirement with no matcher binds nothing; position is never a reason to bind
  invariant a candidate binds at most one requirement (a matching, not a broadcast)
  invariant every binding carries a witness saying why it matched
  forbidden_inference artifact exists -> supports the claim
  forbidden_inference positional slot fill -> semantic evidence match
  native_format graf
  source_path 10-Code/BonfyreControlPlane/evidence_binding.py
  source_path 10-Code/BonfyreControlPlane/institution_loop.py
  witness 10-Code/BonfyreControlPlane/tests/test_evidence_binding.py
  witness 10-Code/BonfyreControlPlane/tests/test_loop_evidence_binding.py
  source_lineage SEED-A recursive organ document

architecture serm
  canonical_name SERMReductionGraph
  family evidence
  domain Evidence / Measurement
  layer evidence
  semantic_question What measurement plan, reduced honestly, produces sufficient evidence for this capability demand?
  purpose Measurement contract -> plan -> provider contract -> reduction -> sufficiency + honesty audit -> ledger. Produces EvidenceGraph/ProofFrontier consequences; is not those structures.
  maturity implemented
  node_types MeasurementContract
  node_types Measurement
  node_types SufficiencyAudit
  node_types ProviderHonestyAudit
  edge_types reduces
  edge_types audits
  internal_calculus reduction over recorded frontier measurements (no re-running mature substrate)
  invariant a required layer counts as covered only by a witness-backed measurement
  invariant a measured/proven claim with no witness fails the honesty audit (laundering)
  forbidden_inference provider confidence -> evidence
  forbidden_inference a claimed plane -> a witnessed measurement
  source_path 10-Code/BonfyreControlPlane/serm.py
  witness 10-Code/BonfyreControlPlane/tests/test_serm.py
  source_lineage SEED-A recursive organ document
  known_gap consumes proof-frontier measurements; the full measurement-plan / HVM-reduction front-end is future
